oken byte without verifying that it is whitespace. It therefore accepts an invalid byte such as 0xFF before the colon. The fix checks that every skipped byte is a space or tab and otherwise returns Error::HeaderName. The regression test added by this commit exercises this case. This plan reverses only the header-name parsing implementation; no tests were run.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T20:50:03.990010+00:00"}
